786 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 406 0 R
/T (The A-bu drone de tection and interference interception device is designed strictly according to military standards. It mainly has two fu nctions. The detection function can analyze the communication link signals between drones and remote controls, obtainin g various data such as the unique serial number, model, location, altitude, speed, altitude above sea level, heading, takeoff point, return point, and pilot position of the drone, and displaying them on the device's display screen. It  can also be combined with our company's software to plot the unmanned aerial vehicle's position, pilot position,  heading, and trajectory on a map, facilitating the rapid positioning and tracking of unmanned aerial vehicles and  pilots. The jamming function operates through the data link of the jamming unmanned aerial vehicle, the map transmission link, and the navigation link, cutting off the communication and navigation signals between the unmanned aerial vehicle and the remote control, thereby forcing the unmanned aerial vehicle to automatically descend or be driven away,performing control tasks to ensure low-altitude airspace safety.)
/E (The A-bu drone de tection and interference interception device is designed strictly according to military standards. It mainly has two fu nctions. The detection function can analyze the communication link signals between drones and remote controls, obtainin g various data such as the unique serial number, model, location, altitude, speed, altitude above sea level, heading, takeoff point, return point, and pilot position of the drone, and displaying them on the device's display screen. It  can also be combined with our company's software to plot the unmanned aerial vehicle's position, pilot position,  heading, and trajectory on a map, facilitating the rapid positioning and tracking of unmanned aerial vehicles and  pilots. The jamming function operates through the data link of the jamming unmanned aerial vehicle, the map transmission link, and the navigation link, cutting off the communication and navigation signals between the unmanned aerial vehicle and the remote control, thereby forcing the unmanned aerial vehicle to automatically descend or be driven away,performing control tasks to ensure low-altitude airspace safety.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
