891 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 408 0 R
/T (The suitcase-style unm anned aerial vehicle \(UAV\) anti-countermeasure device is a new type of UAV anti-countermeasure deve loped mainly for security hidden threats caused by unmanned aerial vehicle black flights. The main customer groups are public security and military departments. The device mainly consists of an UAV positioning module and an UAV interference interception module. The UAV positioning module can obtain various data information such as the unique serial number, model, position, altitude, speed, elevation, heading, takeoff point, return point, pilot's position of the UAV by analyzing the communication link signals between the UAV and the remote controller. Combined with our company's platform software, it can plot the UAV position, pilot's position, heading, and trajectory on a map  for quick positioning and tracking.)
/E (The suitcase-style unm anned aerial vehicle \(UAV\) anti-countermeasure device is a new type of UAV anti-countermeasure deve loped mainly for security hidden threats caused by unmanned aerial vehicle black flights. The main customer groups are public security and military departments. The device mainly consists of an UAV positioning module and an UAV interference interception module. The UAV positioning module can obtain various data information such as the unique serial number, model, position, altitude, speed, elevation, heading, takeoff point, return point, pilot's position of the UAV by analyzing the communication link signals between the UAV and the remote controller. Combined with our company's platform software, it can plot the UAV position, pilot's position, heading, and trajectory on a map  for quick positioning and tracking.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
