/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 413 0 R
/T (Unmanned aerial vehicle navigation spoofing equipment is a standardized product that meets the requirements of the 'Electric Power System Safety Anti-terrorism Prevention Regulations' and the 'Petroleum and Petrochemical System Safety Anti-terrorism Prevention Regulations'. By transmitting low-power retransmitted satellite signals into the 'black aircraft' unmanned aerial vehicle navigation system, it intercepts and controls drones that require satellite navigation systems for flight control, preventing them from entering protected areas and ensuring low-altitude safety in those areas. The product is rigorously designed and produced according to the standards for civilian wireless radio products. In [year], the product was inspected by the National Wireless Radio Testing Center and obtained the corresponding test report.)
/E (Unmanned aerial vehicle navigation spoofing equipment is a standardized product that meets the requirements of the 'Electric Power System Safety Anti-terrorism Prevention Regulations' and the 'Petroleum and Petrochemical System Safety Anti-terrorism Prevention Regulations'. By transmitting low-power retransmitted satellite signals into the 'black aircraft' unmanned aerial vehicle navigation system, it intercepts and controls drones that require satellite navigation systems for flight control, preventing them from entering protected areas and ensuring low-altitude safety in those areas. The product is rigorously designed and produced according to the standards for civilian wireless radio products. In [year], the product was inspected by the National Wireless Radio Testing Center and obtained the corresponding test report.)
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [1]
>>
