/Title (The unmanned aerial vehicle interference jammer is a specialized device designed strictly  according to military standards, specifically for dealing with unauthorized unmanned aerial vehicle threats. It mainly has two functions. The detection function can analyze the communication link signals between the unmanned aerial vehicle and the remote control to obtain various data such as the unique serial number, model, location, altitude, speed, bearing, heading, takeoff point, return point, and pilot position of the unmanned aerial vehicle. This information is displayed on the display screen carried by the device. Additionally, it can be combined with our company's software to plot the unmanned aerial vehicle's position, pilot position, heading, and trajectory on a map.This facilitates the rapid positioning and tracking of drones and pilots. The jamming function operates through data links between manned aircraft, satellite communication links, and navigation links. It cuts off communication and navigation signals between manned aircraft and remote controllers, forcing drones to land automatically or be driven away to perform control tasks and ensure the safety of low-altitude airspace.Blocklist and)
